.ETF
====

.ETF (EXIF-Truncation-Format) is a privacy-based
image format. It is hardcoded to not have any
EXIF-data which saves time as you will not have
to use any 3rd-Party Tools.


I want to use .ETF
==================

To bad! It is not available YET.

Documentation
=============

Specification: https://github.com/Orsacle/ETF/blob/main/docs/spec.md
Getting started: https://github.com/Orsacle/ETF/blob/main/docs/start.md
API Ref: https://github.com/Orsacle/ETF/blob/main/docs/api.md
Guides: https://github.com/Orsacle/ETF/blob/main/docs/guides.md


Where did .ORS go?
==================

.ORS was written extremly bad and had no
documentation at ALL (boo). So i decided
to completely re-write .ORS in Golang.
Also I do not like the name .ORS so that
has changed too.


